From 4a2d749b4c74bcf26c941539f65fba435e2c81ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jon West <electrikjesus@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 10:27:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Taskbar: Let the system bar pick its home screen background

The tablet system bar on the home screen showed whatever the stock
taskbar drew there: nothing when the bar lined up with the hotseat or a
product turned the nav bar scrim off, a tinted band otherwise. With
bar_background in retro_ui_applied it draws its own instead: solid (the
bar color), gradient (a shadow fading to dark at the bottom, as Android
4.x drew behind its navigation buttons), translucent (half-opaque bar
color) or transparent (nothing). Apps keep the stock background.

Change-Id: I8ee8ecb0217d5d6eee596d9bf544932ac386d546
---
